<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 42pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>学生点名：各班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 42pt; mso-char-indent-count: 3.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>外校学生点名：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">汪陈帅<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>六、安全纪律教育</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>负责人：各班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>要</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>求：各班必须进行一次体检安全纪律教育，主要内容如下</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">1</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>、交通安全</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）各班学生必须随车跟带队班主任统一行动，去回均应乘学校安排的大客车，去回</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">上</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>车前班主任要负责清点本班学生数。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）有序上车，不要争抢座位，车内保持安静。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>2</B></SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>、体检纪律</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>听从带队领导和医务人员的指挥，在体检场内保持安静，不得大声喧哗，不得离队任意行动，更不要跑动，以免血压、心率异常（血压以当天检查为准，不得复检）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .49; mso-para-margin-left: 2.57gd"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>、其他事项</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）有关体检情况由考试院转交学校统一发放。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: -6pt; mso-char-indent-count: -.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.0gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）实事求是，不得冒名顶替，一经发现严肃处理。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）严禁修改体检表上医生填写的信息。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）搞好个人卫生（洗脚、洗澡、内衣裤整洁）。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）禁止带手机、零食。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 53.95pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.28gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）<B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal">住院做过手术留有明显疤痕的要带上医院的手术证明（阑尾炎手术除外），体检时医生要查验。</B></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 53.95pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.5; mso-para-margin-left: 2.28gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">7</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）体检时如果对检查结果有异议，应该及时提出申请或叫带队领导和校医转达申请。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"> <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 47.95pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; mso-para-margin-left: 2.28gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">8</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）如果身体上有涉及个人隐私方面的疤痕等情况，可以向带队校医或体检医生反映，申请单独体检。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 23.95pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.28gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">9</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）不能戴隐形眼镜</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 23.95pt; mso-para-margin-left: 2.28gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">10</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">体检过程中途不得离开，如有急事需要离开，须报告班主任和带队校医<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.75pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>七、有关检查结果复查</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.9pt; mso-para-margin-left: 3.42gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">全面体检复查，</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: red">4</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: red">27</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日上午</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: red">8</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>：</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: red">00</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>自己到市立医院</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>注意：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 35.9pt; mso-para-margin-left: 3.42gd"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>过期不再</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">复查，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>申请复检的学生先到学校医务室领取、填好《高校招生体检复查申请表》，带好高考报名证，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">复查仍然在</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>市立医院（原第六医院，延安路</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">468</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>号），来去注意安全，最好有家长陪同。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.5pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.45"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>八、全面体检时间安排</SPAN></B></P>
