<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>九、班主任注意：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 12pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班主任随班行动，一个班级去回乘同一辆车，按规定车号上车，各班提前<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>分钟到校门口集中。班主任清点本班学生数，如有请假学生及时与周文龙和校医联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: .98"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">2. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">班主任统一带好本班学生的高考报名证，拍胸片的条形码贴在高考报名证左下角，<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: .98"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">高考报名证在拍胸片的地方发给学生，此后要学生自行保管，遗失不补。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.8pt; mso-char-indent-count: .98"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．有关上课安排：轮到体检的班级，体检这半天的课改自修。不参加体检的班级按课表上课，带队班主任的课改自修，冲掉的课任课老师可视情况自行调到空缺的地方补上。 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .49"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．各班的租车费（<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>元<SPAN lang=EN-US>/</SPAN>人）上车前准备好，指定一位班干部交</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>汽运公司工作人员。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .99"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．体检主检单位地址：市立医院（原第六医院，延安路<SPAN lang=EN-US>468</SPAN>号）。大部分的体检项目在对面老图书馆<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>楼大厅进行。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 11.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .99"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">．联系医生电话</SPAN><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">88055629</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt">王医师。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 5.9pt; mso-char-indent-count: .49"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
